# C12 (2026-11-23): organ off while a song plays asks with the hold screen (3 s of the encoder button), not Ano/Ne
tick 3000
state power=1
event playing 406A
expect screen nowplaying
event poweroff
expect screen hold
expect text Nouzove stop
expect text Drzte 3 s
expect var power=1
# a short press does nothing; releasing early starts the bar over
key enter
expect screen hold
hold 1500
release
expect screen hold
expect var power=1
# turning the encoder cancels
key down
expect screen nowplaying
expect var power=1
# holding 3 s switches the organ off
event poweroff
expect screen hold
hold 2900
expect screen hold
expect var power=1
hold 100
expect screen abort
expect text Preruseno
expect text Nouzove
expect notext Varhany vypnuty
expect var power=0
expect var aborts=1
# any key closes it, the main menu follows (stack cleared: no player behind)
key enter
expect screen main
